{"kind": "mod", "id": 2091, "name": "Entry Point Selector", "slug": "entry-point-selector", "teaser": "A client mod that easily allows you to choose where to spawn in as PMC or Scav, and supports customization via the F12 menu.", "owner_name": "Devraccoon", "downloads": 14544, "favourites": 19, "featured": false, "contains_ads": false, "contains_ai_content": false, "cheat_notice": false, "license_name": "MIT License", "guid": "com.hazelify.entrypointselector", "thumbnail_local": null, "category": "Scripting", "category_id": 3, "updated_at": "2026-07-28T07:56:17.000000Z", "created_at": "2025-04-10T00:13:30.000000Z", "published_at": "2025-04-10T00:13:00.000000Z", "latest_constraint": "~4.0 <4.1.0", "latest_version": "1.3.0", "has_local": false, "has_github": false, "license_link": "https://choosealicense.com/licenses/mit/", "description_html": "<p>I’ve been wanting an updated and more optimal, ideal version of the <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/582-select-entry-point/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><strong>Select Entry Point</strong></a> mod, so I made a new client mod that updates but also expands the options and settings.</p>\n<p><em><strong>Please contact me via my Discord if you encounter errors. ALWAYS BRING YOUR BEPINEX LOGS!</strong></em></p>\n<div class=\"tabset\"><div id=\"tabset-1-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Features</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><blockquote>\n<p><strong>NOTE:</strong>  DO NOT CONFUSE THIS WITH <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/1680/entry-point-selector-20\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Entry Point Selector 2.0</a>!<br />\nThis mod works entirely through the F12 BepInEx menu</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>This mod supports the following:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Spawning in to the exact same place you last exfiltrated from (provided it’s the same map)</li>\n<li>Choosing which exfil zone you’d like to spawn nearby.</li>\n<li>Spawning in to the <strong><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/2707-home-comforts/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Home Comforts’ portable Safehouse</a></strong> exfil point. If used, the <code>**Spawn into your last exfil</code>** option will be disabled.</li>\n</ul></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Core section</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><h3>Spawn into your last exfil</h3>\n<p>If you want to spawn where you last exfiltrated (on the same map)</p>\n<h3>Choose infil spawn</h3>\n<p>If you want to choose which exfil to spawn nearby on the given map</p>\n<h3>Wipe saved exfil spawn data</h3>\n<p>Wipes all existing player spawn data for all maps (<code>use with caution!</code>)</p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-3\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">All available maps</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><h3>&lt;Map&gt; Spawn Zone</h3>\n<p>Which exfil you want to spawn near as a PMC (regular player)</p>\n<h3>&lt;Map&gt; Scav Spawn Zone</h3>\n<p>Which exfil you want to spawn near as a Scav</p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-4\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Home Comforts</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><h3>Mod detection</h3>\n<p>If HC is installed, it will disable <code>Spawn into your last exfil</code> and override it</p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-5\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Installation</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><ol>\n<li>Download the mod</li>\n<li>Open the <strong><code>hazelify.EntryPointSelector.zip</code></strong> archive with <strong><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.7-zip.org/download.html\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">7-Zip</a></strong></li>\n<li>Drag-and-drop the <strong><code>BepInEx</code></strong> folder into your main SPT folder (where EscapeFromTarkov.exe resides)</li>\n<li>Profit</li>\n</ol></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-6\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Available settings</div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-7\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Showcase</div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-8\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Credits</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p><strong><code>net.hazelify</code></strong> on Discord. For support, go to the <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://discord.com/invite/Xn9msqQZan\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">SPT Discord community</a> and ping me!</p></div></div></div>\n", "versions": [{"version": "1.0.4+311", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.11.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 3524, "published_at": "2025-04-13T22:45:58.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/2091/entry-point-selector/1.0.4+311", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.0.5", "spt_version_constraint": "~4.0.0", "content_length": 59371, "downloads": 1986, "published_at": "2025-10-12T15:24:00.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/2091/entry-point-selector/1.0.5", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.1.0", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.11.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 376, "published_at": "2025-11-08T22:02:00.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/2091/entry-point-selector/1.1.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.2.0", "spt_version_constraint": "~4.0.0", "content_length": 59433, "downloads": 2983, "published_at": "2025-11-08T22:03:00.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/2091/entry-point-selector/1.2.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.